ReefGauge
Copyright (c) 2026 Scott Deyo. All rights reserved.

This repository is public so that ReefGauge terminals can update themselves.
A shipped unit is a git checkout and pulls its releases from here with no
credentials, which is only possible if the repository can be read by anyone.

That is the whole reason it is readable. It is not an offer of permission.


